    "- **PageRank**: Google’s PageRank algorithm uses a variant of a random walk to rank websites by their importance based on link structure.\n",
    "- **Diffusion in Social Networks**: Models information spread, where each \"walker\" represents the spread of ideas, memes, or infections.\n",
